# Uldaros Theorix targets the Ornithopter (a creature) and the Black Lotus (an artifact) in Bot1's graveyard. In response Bot2's
# Deathrite Shaman exiles the Ornithopter ({G}, {T}: exile target creature card from a graveyard). That target is now illegal
# (CR 608.2b, 400.7): the ability does the rest - the Lotus is exiled, copied and cast (as a token), while the Ornithopter
# is neither exiled by it nor copied or cast: it is the Shaman's exile that put it there, and it stays a card in exile
# with no token of it on the battlefield.

